OL,3,AAt least 21 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams Pakistan mosque
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car-bomb attack on a mosque in
OL,7,Fnorth-western Pakistan has killed at
OL,8,Fleast 21 people and injured more than
OL,9,F100, officials say.
OL,11,FFifteen police officers and a
OL,12,Ffour-year-old child are among those
OL,13,Fkilled in the attack, which also
OL,14,Finvolved gunmen firing on a police
OL,15,Ffacility in the city of Kohat in the
OL,16,Fprovince of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, the
OL,17,FPakistan's APP news agency reported.
OL,19,FVideo found by BBC Verify shows the
OL,20,Fsite covered in rubble and people
OL,21,Ftending to casualties.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
